us, and lend us the strength to carry on...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_7","text":"No one will save us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_8","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_9","text":"The only one that can save us is us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_10","text":"We must keep those who are gone in our hearts, and continue to fight for those who are still alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_11","text":"But what of those poor souls who died in vain?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_12","text":"Who said their deaths were in vain?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_13","text":"What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_14","text":"Who says that those who are buried here died for nothing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_15","text":"This is the first time I've heard such a sentiment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_16","text":"You may not hear it, but you know it in your heart.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_17","text":"Those who perished do not feel they died a meaningless death.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_18","text":"That I can promise you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_19","text":"They proudly gave their lives and remained brave until the very end.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_20","text":"No. They cry out in anguish, bemoaning the injustice of it all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"pinne","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_21","text":"None of them would ever think that, let alone say it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"pinne","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_22","text":"Having fought alongside them, this much I know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_23","text":"Then what is it that I'm hearing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_24","text":"Then what is this voice stricken with such grief, crying out at this injustice?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_25","text":"That's how you feel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_26","text":"What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_27","text":"All of these soldiers gave their lives in a battle they never signed up for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_28","text":"The Ark that we're putting our lives on the line for isn't responding to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_29","text":"That's why you're upset.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_30","text":"We have no food or water, the electricity is down, and countless soldiers have died.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_31","text":"We never know when the Raptures will strike at us next. We're on edge day and night.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_32","text":"You're exhausted and want to give up, but your comrades who lifted you up and cheered you on","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_33","text":"are no longer here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_34","text":"That's why you're lost.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_35","text":"... Dorothy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_36","text":"Just as I miss Lilith, you miss Red Hood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_37","text":"But they are no longer with us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_38","text":"Getting yourself killed won't mean you'll get to them again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_39","text":"You want to hear their voice again, but you can't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_40","text":"We cannot see or communicate with the dead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_41","text":"If you say you hear their voices, then you're only lying to yourself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_42","text":"You're only hearing","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_43","text":"what you want to hear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_44","text":"An illusion of your own creation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_45","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_46","text":"Listen to my voice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_47","text":"I'm asking for your help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_48","text":"I'm right in front of you, living and breathing, talking to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_49","text":"And I'm offering my hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_50","text":"I'm hoping that you'll take it, and stand up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_51","text":"The dead...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_52","text":"can't pull you up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_53","text":"They can only pull you down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_54","text":"Dorothy...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_55","text":"Take my hand, one that's living,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_56","text":"and get up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_57","text":"If we fall, we'll fall together. If we get back up, we'll do it together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_58","text":"We are the Goddess Squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_overzone1_05_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_overzone1_05_s_59","text":"Mankind's last hope. The Goddess of Victory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":